          "content": "OLD_RAW_0 Objective: harden the agent runtime while preserving all execution authority."
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Decision: Keep Runtime boundary as the sole authority for filesystem side effects."
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "Constraint: traces must never contain prompts, Tool inputs, or Tool outputs."
        },
        {
